<title>USA: St Michael, Minn., won by Cronin &amp; Co.</title>
<headline>St Michael, Minn., won by Cronin &amp; Co.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cronin &amp; Co said it won $2.365 million of St. Michael, Minn., general obligation improvement bonds, Series 1997, with a true interest cost of 4.95 percent.</p>
</text>
